# format=FAST
# Fusion MS-WB670 at source 51, captured 2026-09-18 on a live bus.
#
# 130820 message id 32865 (0x8061) "Zone Capabilities Extended" -- named in
# FUSION_STATUS_MESSAGE_ID but never decoded. 40 payload bytes = five 8-byte
# records, one per zone slot plus a global slot, in the same order as the
# existing 32798 "Capabilities" message.
#
# The first two bytes of each record are EXACTLY the corresponding 16-bit word
# of 32798, which the unit sent in the same window -- so the layout is
# confirmed against a PGN canboat already decodes, with no guesswork:
#
#   Capabilities (32798)   Zone 1 0xFDFF  Zone 2 0xBDFF  Zone 3 0xB7FF  Zone 4 0  Global 0
#   Extended     (32865)   record 0xFDFF  record 0xBDFF  record 0xB7FF  0000       0000
#
# The remaining six bytes of each populated record read 02,00,00,00,00,00 and
# are zero for the unpopulated slots; their meaning is not yet established, so
# this capture is evidence for the record framing, not for those six bytes.
#
